Strata's interactor model — a one-shot `StrataInteractor` paired with a streaming
`StrataSubjectInteractor`, and the idea of tracking loading state separately for
user-initiated and ambient work so that background refreshes do not flash a
spinner — was informed by the `Interactor` / `SubjectInteractor` types in Tivi:

    Tivi
    Copyright 2019 Google LLC
    https://github.com/chrisbanes/tivi
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Trapeze's overall shape — a screen as a routing key, a composable state producer,
a stateless UI, and factory-based resolution of the two from that key — follows
the unidirectional-data-flow approach popularised for Compose by Circuit:

    Circuit
    Copyright 2022 Slack Technologies, LLC
    https://github.com/slackhq/circuit
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

These acknowledgements record influence and are offered in good faith. No source
was copied from Circuit. Strata's interactors began closer to Tivi's and have
since been re-derived for MESA; this notice is retained because the underlying
ideas are not MESA's own.
